  "html": "<p><strong>參訪EMRD學長任職企業活動(三)－08/18&nbsp;緯創 Wistron </strong><br> 暑期第三場參訪由施劭儒執行長帶隊院內學生前往Wistron 緯創資通位於汐止的園區，感謝緯創充實的導覽內容與徵才安排!<br> 從公司簡介、介紹各單位組織與職務內容，還進一步教導同學求職技巧，更透過實地參觀辦公環境與實驗室，更加了解就職生活與福利。<br> 更多參訪照片請看:<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11q_sConrbmfyghmic4YI320RY52d4OxH?usp=sharing\" title=\"album\"><u>https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11q_sConrbmfyghmic4YI320RY52d4OxH?usp=sharing</u></a></p>\n<p><strong>參訪EMRD學長任職企業活動(四)－08/19</strong>&nbsp;<strong>鈊象 IGS</strong></p>\n<p>暑期最後一場參訪到了有EMRD多位校友的鈊象電子參訪，感謝鈊象熱情接待與學長的工作經驗分享演講。<br> 透過EMRD 何承家學長的自身工作經驗分享，以及現場到研發部參觀大型遊戲機台、電玩間等，對於公司的產品與職涯內容深入了解。<br> 感謝學長們的用心安排，讓外籍生的暑期收穫滿滿!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E6%9A%91%E6%9C%9F%E4%BC%81%E6%A5%AD%E5%8F%83%E8%A8%AA?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDgg5tHVrgo0cP1C3EVi7qM7L132SfjSYan_ReSjVHEQiM_mT9Z76VD0CoA4XYVuSYE2xb9sM6Yk5fzCphdah__91l5mTIAbC2lh5w-VsGSGWFHI1NIq7fvyhcKwJVbPJ-lT7riA6BUVUuxwEjAbfOW3dbaitl5M9Iye3V23QVVJ9HAKDVYhhCuji9pslVdpmoZCw0ouV3DrfxU3Vu32mU1viL8pXbPILuf5UOB1ll_pzIUk27N8dyUSChQJvW0-btTnDxigT3rpNipcJ4An1n_-h2QEN_eOGcws6ndmlkrxb1GNPzlHjlwUCarvj0WZPH8utH22p2EBRErzgE9CaBCnJbs&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#暑期企業參訪</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E6%8E%A5%E8%BB%8C%E4%BC%81%E6%A5%AD?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDgg5tHVrgo0cP1C3EVi7qM7L132SfjSYan_ReSjVHEQiM_mT9Z76VD0CoA4XYVuSYE2xb9sM6Yk5fzCphdah__91l5mTIAbC2lh5w-VsGSGWFHI1NIq7fvyhcKwJVbPJ-lT7riA6BUVUuxwEjAbfOW3dbaitl5M9Iye3V23QVVJ9HAKDVYhhCuji9pslVdpmoZCw0ouV3DrfxU3Vu32mU1viL8pXbPILuf5UOB1ll_pzIUk27N8dyUSChQJvW0-btTnDxigT3rpNipcJ4An1n_-h2QEN_eOGcws6ndmlkrxb1GNPzlHjlwUCarvj0WZPH8utH22p2EBRErzgE9CaBCnJbs&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#接軌企業</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A0%E5%B0%B1%E6%A5%AD%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83?__eep__=6&amp;source=feed_text&amp;epa=HASHTAG&amp;__xts__%5B0%5D=68.ARDgg5tHVrgo0cP1C3EVi7qM7L132SfjSYan_ReSjVHEQiM_mT9Z76VD0CoA4XYVuSYE2xb9sM6Yk5fzCphdah__91l5mTIAbC2lh5w-VsGSGWFHI1NIq7fvyhcKwJVbPJ-lT7riA6BUVUuxwEjAbfOW3dbaitl5M9Iye3V23QVVJ9HAKDVYhhCuji9pslVdpmoZCw0ouV3DrfxU3Vu32mU1viL8pXbPILuf5UOB1ll_pzIUk27N8dyUSChQJvW0-btTnDxigT3rpNipcJ4An1n_-h2QEN_eOGcws6ndmlkrxb1GNPzlHjlwUCarvj0WZPH8utH22p2EBRErzgE9CaBCnJbs&amp;__tn__=%2ANK-R\">#增加就業機會</a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"緯創團體合影\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/70e4b57ec7-mczh-tw1920x700-large3434-798329094921.jpg\" width=\"934\"><figcaption>緯創團體合影</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"EMRD學長-何承家部長演講\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/89a541b402-mczh-tw1920x700-large3435-96635194921.jpg\" width=\"932\"><figcaption>EMRD學長-何承家部長演講</figcaption></figure>",
